\subsection{\href{https://beta.lmfdb.org/knowledge/show/intro.mcp}{MCP server}}
\begin{definition}\label{intro.mcp}
\uses{}
\leanok
You can connect the LMFDB to many large language models by using the [MCP server](https://github.com/AndrewVSutherland/lmfdb-mcp).  This allows the models to query the LMFDB via a direct SQL connection in order to answer natural language queries.
\end{definition}


